(7484152, 1190890, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh!   This is gorgeous!<br/> <br/> <br/>Yours is the first image up for me...  <br/> <br/>Gee GOLLY!  I hope they ALL aren''t as fabulous as yours! <br/> <br/>The light, the colors... the focus.    Nicely done!</td>', 'Oh!   This is gorgeous!  Yours is the first image up for me...   Gee GOLLY!  I hope they ALL aren''t as fabulous as yours!  The light, the colors... the focus.    Nicely done!', '2016-11-25 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484155, 1191150, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I LOVE the error in your title... <br/> <br/>Makes it all adorable.</td>', 'Ha!  I LOVE the error in your title...  Makes it all adorable.', '2016-11-25 00:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484159, 1191142, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks like something Alex would do! Love the minimalism, the subtle blue and perfect smoothness of the water! Ribbon for sure!</td>', 'Looks like something Alex would do! Love the minimalism, the subtle blue and perfect smoothness of the water! Ribbon for sure!', '2016-11-25 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484160, 1190638, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! Karen??</td>', 'Lovely shot! Karen??', '2016-11-25 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484166, 1191110, 75343, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2016-11-25 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484167, 1190890, 75343, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2016-11-25 00:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484274, 1190523, 112739, '<td valign="top">Spectacular work! The technique creates another dimension. I am surprised by lack of cloud movement during this long exposure and actually happy to see plenty of definition there. 10 for sure.</td>', 'Spectacular work! The technique creates another dimension. I am surprised by lack of cloud movement during this long exposure and actually happy to see plenty of definition there. 10 for sure.', '2016-11-26 11:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484275, 1191096, 112739, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely.</td>', 'This is very lovely.', '2016-11-26 11:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484276, 1191142, 112739, '<td valign="top">That blue tone is perfect to take the eye in and not distract with unwanted colors.</td>', 'That blue tone is perfect to take the eye in and not distract with unwanted colors.', '2016-11-26 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484346, 1191144, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued.... am I seeing two men standing behind each other, or one who moved his head during the exposure?</td>', 'I''m intrigued.... am I seeing two men standing behind each other, or one who moved his head during the exposure?', '2016-11-27 00:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484348, 1191110, 6519, '<td valign="top">I will vote as if I believed the 30-second exposure, but I will admit I''m having a very hard time with that.<br/>There are sharp ripples on the water (instead of just floaty smooth stuff), and NO movement on the boat or the foreground leaves - I simply can''t imagine that to be such a long exposure.</td>', 'I will vote as if I believed the 30-second exposure, but I will admit I''m having a very hard time with that.There are sharp ripples on the water (instead of just floaty smooth stuff), and NO movement on the boat or the foreground leaves - I simply can''t imagine that to be such a long exposure.', '2016-11-27 01:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
