(7485494, 1191150, 50864, '<td valign="top">Such a strange and funny light paining. 8</td>', 'Such a strange and funny light paining. 8', '2016-12-01 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485496, 1190757, 24744, '<td valign="top">Having the horizon level would have improved this.</td>', 'Having the horizon level would have improved this.', '2016-12-01 20:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485497, 1191185, 24744, '<td valign="top">There''s a thin patch of shadow beneath the lights of the hut which is darker than the rest of the surrounding hillside, and looks very artificial - fixing that would improve this somewhat.</td>', 'There''s a thin patch of shadow beneath the lights of the hut which is darker than the rest of the surrounding hillside, and looks very artificial - fixing that would improve this somewhat.', '2016-12-01 21:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485498, 1191096, 24744, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and the brave composition - central and framed below middle - works very well here.  One nit to pick is that I can see distinct steps in gradation in the the tones in the sky, from excess contrast / saturation changes there - I would have smoothed this out in postprocessing.  There''s also what looks like a bit of flare in the lower left above the trees that could be cleaned up.  Still, one of my highest scores in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject, and the brave composition - central and framed below middle - works very well here.  One nit to pick is that I can see distinct steps in gradation in the the tones in the sky, from excess contrast / saturation changes there - I would have smoothed this out in postprocessing.  There''s also what looks like a bit of flare in the lower left above the trees that could be cleaned up.  Still, one of my highest scores in this challenge.', '2016-12-01 21:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485499, 1191058, 24744, '<td valign="top">Very strong work, flawless tones and clarity, well composed, not oversharpened... excellent!  The only tiny flaw is you missed cloning out a dust spot; it being located on the intersection of the lower left third makes it especially prominent.  One of my highest scores in this contest.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-12-02 08:10:22.</i></td>', 'Very strong work, flawless tones and clarity, well composed, not oversharpened... excellent!  The only tiny flaw is you missed cloning out a dust spot; it being located on the intersection of the lower left third makes it especially prominent.  One of my highest scores in this contest.', '2016-12-01 21:05:47.000000', '2016-12-02 08:10:22.000000', 1),
(7485500, 1191128, 24744, '<td valign="top">This subject would have worked better without such a strong colour cast, and I''m not a fan of the asymmetrical border (white stripe thicker on the right and below).</td>', 'This subject would have worked better without such a strong colour cast, and I''m not a fan of the asymmetrical border (white stripe thicker on the right and below).', '2016-12-01 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485501, 1190526, 24744, '<td valign="top">Fascinating concept, and the ghostly skyline in the background adds a good twist to an old cliche.  You have a circle of flare in the upper middle that I''d have cleaned up.  One of my highest scores in this contest.</td>', 'Fascinating concept, and the ghostly skyline in the background adds a good twist to an old cliche.  You have a circle of flare in the upper middle that I''d have cleaned up.  One of my highest scores in this contest.', '2016-12-01 21:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485502, 1190890, 24744, '<td valign="top">You have some odd colour fringing around the greens under the jetty.</td>', 'You have some odd colour fringing around the greens under the jetty.', '2016-12-01 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485503, 1191105, 24744, '<td valign="top">You have some dark halos around the tops of the crags against the sky, which break my suspension of disbelief and draw attention to the postprocessing done here.  The rocks and clouds breaking the right edge of the frame all conspire to lead the eye out of the image on that side and leave the composition feeling a bit unbalanced; aside from that though, the composition is overall strong and the tones (dubious dodging/burning aside) are excellent.  Still one of my highest scores in the challenge.</td>', 'You have some dark halos around the tops of the crags against the sky, which break my suspension of disbelief and draw attention to the postprocessing done here.  The rocks and clouds breaking the right edge of the frame all conspire to lead the eye out of the image on that side and leave the composition feeling a bit unbalanced; aside from that though, the composition is overall strong and the tones (dubious dodging/burning aside) are excellent.  Still one of my highest scores in the challenge.', '2016-12-01 21:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485504, 1190871, 24744, '<td valign="top">there are some strange stripy noise patterns on the cloud which distract from an otherwise very strong image.</td>', 'there are some strange stripy noise patterns on the cloud which distract from an otherwise very strong image.', '2016-12-01 21:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485518, 1191101, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effectively dream-like quality, or a fading memory. voted earlier</td>', 'Effectively dream-like quality, or a fading memory. voted earlier', '2016-12-01 22:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485519, 1191172, 94815, '<td valign="top">Jackson Pollack through a glass painterly, maybe. voted earlier</td>', 'Jackson Pollack through a glass painterly, maybe. voted earlier', '2016-12-01 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485522, 1190526, 94815, '<td valign="top">What makes this for me is not the fading surfers (really among those rocks?), but the faint skyline that registers as an afterthought when viewing the image. What I think of as a delay effect, and a neat one. bump</td>', 'What makes this for me is not the fading surfers (really among those rocks?), but the faint skyline that registers as an afterthought when viewing the image. What I think of as a delay effect, and a neat one. bump', '2016-12-01 22:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485523, 1191114, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not many side streets with a bike lane. Trying to remember where is the clock tower - maybe University Ave or Lafayette St or somewhere in the East Village. Anyway, nicely executed long exposure. voted earlier</td>', 'Not many side streets with a bike lane. Trying to remember where is the clock tower - maybe University Ave or Lafayette St or somewhere in the East Village. Anyway, nicely executed long exposure. voted earlier', '2016-12-01 22:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
