(7485611, 1191095, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Waitingsilence:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> One of my highest scores. Congrats on the HM! Would love to come and shoot some landscapes with you guys. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much Dennis!<br/> <br/>I''m really glad you liked this!<br/> <br/>Let us know if you''ll ever come to Italy, maybe we can arrange something! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Waiting for you in March Dennis! Some crazy landscapes here :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Waitingsilence: Originally posted by Dennisheckman: One of my highest scores. Congrats on the HM! Would love to come and shoot some landscapes with you guys.   Thank you so much Dennis! I''m really glad you liked this! Let us know if you''ll ever come to Italy, maybe we can arrange something!   Waiting for you in March Dennis! Some crazy landscapes here :)', '2016-12-02 11:10:36.000000', NULL, 0),
