(7485840, 1191058, 19959, '<td valign="top">I did not vote this challenge but would have pegged this for a ribbon. It is much more considered than the long exposure seascapes that dominate the top slots.<br/> <br/>The Dust spot was not immediately noticeable... would be annoying on a print but OK for this comp. I might have straightened the cottage as this is a key point of interest, looks like lens distortion has tilted it off vertical.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I did not vote this challenge but would have pegged this for a ribbon. It is much more considered than the long exposure seascapes that dominate the top slots. The Dust spot was not immediately noticeable... would be annoying on a print but OK for this comp. I might have straightened the cottage as this is a key point of interest, looks like lens distortion has tilted it off vertical. ', '2016-12-05 07:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
